<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>IUI / IVF Agreement</title>
    <style>
        /* PDF Printing Optimization: A4 Page Settings */
        @page {
            size: A4;
            margin: 20mm;
        }
        body {
            font-family: "Arial", "Helvetica", sans-serif;
            font-size: 12pt;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #000;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #fff;
        }
        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 210mm; /* A4 Width */
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative; /* For absolute positioning if needed */
        }
        /* Header Styling */
        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18pt;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        /* Section Styling */
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .section-header {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 13pt;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-left: 5px solid #333;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        /* Data Fields */
        .row {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            display: block;
        }
        .label {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 5px;
        }
        .value {
            border-bottom: 1px dotted #333;
            padding: 0 5px;
            display: inline-block;
            min-width: 50px;
        }
        /* Checkbox Styling */
        .checkbox-item {
            margin: 5px 0 5px 20px;
        }
        .check-box {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #000;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 14px;
            margin-right: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        /* Lists */
        ul {
            list-style-type: disc;
            margin: 5px 0 10px 40px;
            padding: 0;
        }
        li {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        /* Signatures Grid */
        .signature-section {
            margin-top: 40px;
            width: 100%;
            display: table;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }
        .sig-col {
            display: table-cell;
            width: 33%;
            vertical-align: top;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 10px;
        }
        .sig-title {
            height: 120px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .sig-status {
            font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14pt;
            color: #333;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            height: 30px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .sig-line {
            border-top: 1px solid #000;
            margin-top: 5px;
            width: 80%;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }
        
        /* Bottom Right Date Styling */
        .footer-date {
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 12pt;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Agreement IUI / IVF</h1>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-header">1. Patient Information</div>
            <div class="row">
                <span class="label">Full Name:</span>
                <span class="value"><%= it.patient.name %></span>
            </div> 
            <div class="row">
                <span class="label">Date of Birth:</span>
                <span class="value"><%= it.patient.dob %></span>
            </div> 
            <div class="row">
                <span class="label">ID / National ID:</span>
                <span class="value"><%= it.patient.nationalId %></span>
            </div> 
            <div class="row">
                <span class="label">Address:</span>
                <span class="value"><%= it.patient.address %></span>
            </div> 
            <div class="row">
                <span class="label">Phone Number:</span>
                <span class="value"><%= it.patient.phone %></span>
            </div> 
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-header">2. Spouse Information (if applicable)</div>
            <div class="row">
                <span class="label">Full Name:</span>
                <span class="value"><%= it.spouse ? it.spouse.name : "N/A" %></span>
            </div> 
            <div class="row">
                <span class="label">Date of Birth:</span>
                <span class="value"><%= it.spouse ? it.spouse.dob : "N/A" %></span>
            </div> 
            <div class="row">
                <span class="label">ID / National ID:</span>
                <span class="value"><%= it.spouse ? it.spouse.nationalId : "N/A" %></span>
            </div> 
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-header">3. Service Type</div>
            <div class="checkbox-item">
                <span class="check-box"><% if (it.serviceType === 'IUI') { %>X<% } %></span>
                <strong>IUI</strong> – Intrauterine Insemination
            </div>
            <div class="checkbox-item">
                <span class="check-box"><% if (it.serviceType === 'IVF') { %>X<% } %></span>
                <strong>IVF</strong> – In Vitro Fertilization
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-header">4. Patient Commitment</div>
            <ul>
                <li>I confirm that I have been fully consulted regarding the procedure, risks, and costs.</li>
                <li>I agree to allow the center to perform the IUI/IVF service according to regulations.</li>
                <li>All information provided is accurate.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-header">5. Medical Facility Commitment</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Perform the procedure according to professional guidelines.</li>
                <li>Maintain confidentiality of patient records.</li>
                <li>Provide clear and complete information throughout the treatment process.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-header">6. Payment Regulations</div>
            <ul>
                <li>Service costs include: examination, testing, medication, and procedures.</li>
                <li>Patients shall pay in stages.</li>
                <li>Non-refundable for treatments that have already been conducted.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="signature-section">
            <div class="sig-col">
                <div class="sig-title">Patient</div>
                <div class="sig-status">
                    <% if (it.signatures.patient) { %>SIGNED<% } %>
                </div>
                <div class="sig-line"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="sig-col">
                <div class="sig-title">Spouse</div>
                <div class="sig-status">
                    <% if (it.signatures.spouse) { %>SIGNED<% } %>
                </div>
                <div class="sig-line"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="sig-col">
                <div class="sig-title">Facility Representative</div>
                <div class="sig-status">
                    <% if (it.signatures.facility) { %>SIGNED<% } %>
                </div>
                <div class="sig-line"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-date">
            Date: <%= it.date %>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>